> Private equity group Penta and the company J 23 a.s. yesterday reached an agreement on the sale of the[ ADA]ST a.s., a manufacturer of printing presses based in Adamov, Czech Republic. J 23, a company with a significant interest in machinery manufacturing, is purchasing 100 % of the shares in[ ADA]ST. The value of the transaction has not been disclosed. The new owner plans to keep the polygraphic manufacturing activities at[ ADA]ST.
